Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.58,0:00:18.58,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1951.704,1855.407)}使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！\N！！真的有人看不到这行字！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.93,0:00:28.93,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1956.149,1882.519)}翻译质量权威评价：原来25年就有小拉即用机翻糊弄人了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.46,0:00:08.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,大家好 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.46,0:00:08.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Hello everyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.04,0:00:12.96,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,在本视频中 我将为大家展示...又一个虚假验证码 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.04,0:00:12.96,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,In this video I will present to you... another fake captcha.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.88,0:00:17.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,虽然过去一周我已经做了5期这类主题的视频 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.88,0:00:17.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,, know I've made like 5 videos on this topic in the past week,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.53,0:00:23.44,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1922.667,324.666)}该视频在2025年8月8日录制
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.02,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但实在抱歉 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.02,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.56,0:00:20.98,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我确实对虚假验证码情有独钟 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.56,0:00:20.98,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I really like fake captchas.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.52,0:00:26.52,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这类视频的播放量实在惨不忍睹 各位似乎也看得厌烦了 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.52,0:00:26.52,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The views on these videos are absolutely horrible and you guys seem to be bored by them.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.84,0:00:27.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但请听我说完 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.84,0:00:27.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But hear me out.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.44,0:00:30.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我有着前瞻性的思维 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:28.44,0:00:30.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I have a visionary mindset.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.04,0:00:33.88,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,虚假验证码很快将会绝迹 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.04,0:00:33.88,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Fake captchas will cease to exist very soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.66,0:00:36.52,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,此刻正是千载难逢的机遇
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.66,0:00:36.52,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Right now is a unique,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.66,0:00:39.88,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,让我们共同把握当下 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.66,0:00:39.88,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,once-in-a-lifetime opportunity for us to gather up together,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.60,0:00:43.32,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,尽情欣赏虚假验证码的最后盛宴 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.60,0:00:43.32,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,enjoy the absolute abundance of fake captchas,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.54,0:00:46.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,在它们消失前全面记录一下
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.54,0:00:46.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and document all of them before they're gone.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.08,0:00:52.72,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,请记住我的话：多年之后 你们定会怀念这类恶意软件 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:47.08,0:00:52.72,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, many years down the line you will be nostalgic about this exact type of malware.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.10,0:00:55.12,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,当这些精妙的骗术全部消失时 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:53.10,0:00:55.12,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But where are you going to turn to,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.34,0:00:57.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你们还能去哪里追寻踪迹？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.34,0:00:57.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,once all of this beautiful stuff is gone?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.04,0:00:59.64,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这就是我的思考逻辑 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:58.04,0:00:59.64,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This is how I think.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.18,0:01:05.52,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我深信早在当年 人们也对虚假反恶意软件烦不胜烦 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.18,0:01:05.52,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I truly believe way back in the day people were super annoyed and bored by the fake anti-malware.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.10,0:01:08.78,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,那时它们遍布互联网每个角落 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:06.10,0:01:08.78,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It was out there in every corner of the internet.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.48,0:01:14.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但看看现在 谁不期盼着能有新型虚假反恶意软件问世？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:09.48,0:01:14.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But look at you now, who's yearning for a new fake anti-malware family to drop?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.02,0:01:17.00,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,恶意软件始终如此演进 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:15.02,0:01:17.00,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This is how malware always has been,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.20,0:01:18.74,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这不过是历史长卷中的又一页 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:17.20,0:01:18.74,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,it's just another page of the book.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.72,0:01:23.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这将是我制作的最后一个虚假验证码视频 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:19.72,0:01:23.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This will be the last fake captcha video I ever make.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.32,0:01:25.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我保证 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:24.32,0:01:25.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.84,0:01:28.90,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但希望五年后的2030年 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.84,0:01:28.90,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But I want you to visit this video 5 years from now,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.96,0:01:31.64,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,各位能重回这个视频 告诉我当年的预言是否成真 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.96,0:01:31.64,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,in 2030, and tell me if I was right.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.34,0:01:36.06,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这是迄今为止最狡诈精密的恶意软件 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:32.34,0:01:36.06,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It is the most clever and crafty malware out there so far.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.80,0:01:38.78,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,从虚假反恶意软件 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:36.80,0:01:38.78,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The evolution from fake anti-malware,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.94,0:01:41.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,到潜在不受欢迎程序 再到浏览器通知诈骗 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:38.94,0:01:41.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,to pups, to browser notification scams,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.78,0:01:43.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,直至如今的虚假验证码 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:41.78,0:01:43.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,to now fake captchas,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.44,0:01:45.34,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,目睹这种演变其实颇具美感
Dialogue: 2,0:01:43.44,0:01:45.34,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,it's honestly beautiful to witness.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.10,0:01:48.62,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,若你在2030年或更晚观看本视频
Dialogue: 2,0:01:46.10,0:01:48.62,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So if you're watching in 2030 and beyond,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.96,0:01:53.06,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,请务必在评论区告诉我 当初保留这些验证码的决定是否正确
Dialogue: 2,0:01:48.96,0:01:53.06,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,please tell me in the comments if I made the right call to preserve all these captchas,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.32,0:01:56.12,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,尽管它们现在被视为乏味的主流设计
Dialogue: 2,0:01:53.32,0:01:56.12,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which are right now considered boring and mainstream.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.12,0:01:59.10,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,当然 前提是那时我还在世且安好
Dialogue: 2,0:01:57.12,0:01:59.10,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Of course if I'm still out there alive and well.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.12,0:02:04.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,言归正传 最后要演示的是伪造的谷歌验证码
Dialogue: 2,0:02:00.12,0:02:04.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But anyways, the final captcha I want to cover is the fake google one,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.68,0:02:06.62,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它能获取你的IP地址
Dialogue: 2,0:02:04.68,0:02:06.62,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which fetches your IP address,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.28,0:02:10.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,外观与正版无异并自动适配平台
Dialogue: 2,0:02:07.28,0:02:10.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,looks exactly like the original and adapts to the platform.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.46,0:02:15.60,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,此刻后台正运行着反检测面板
Dialogue: 2,0:02:12.46,0:02:15.60,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,In the background I have an anti-detect dashboard running.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.16,0:02:19.96,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这个工具能创建带有虚假指纹的浏览器实例
Dialogue: 2,0:02:16.16,0:02:19.96,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's a tool to create instances of browsers with fake fingerprints.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.70,0:02:26.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我将用它展示网站如何调整恶意代码来感染用户
Dialogue: 2,0:02:21.70,0:02:26.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Using that tool I'll show you how the site adapts its malicious shellcode to infect the recipient.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.84,0:02:29.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在准备创建Windows
Dialogue: 2,0:02:27.84,0:02:29.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So I'm going to create Windows,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.68,0:02:31.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,Linux和macOS三种浏览器
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.68,0:02:31.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Linux and macOS browsers.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.98,0:02:33.76,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们快速开始操作
Dialogue: 2,0:02:31.98,0:02:33.76,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So let's go ahead and start real quick.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.62,0:02:43.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你可以选择操作系统 完全修改浏览器指纹及硬件识别方式
Dialogue: 2,0:02:34.62,0:02:43.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So you can select the OS and you can completely modify your browser fingerprint and how it detects your hardware.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.28,0:02:47.00,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这个控制台布满加购弹窗
Dialogue: 2,0:02:44.28,0:02:47.00,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This dashboard contains plenty of upsells,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.22,0:02:53.66,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不过这很合理 毕竟反检测工具主要被用于机器人程序
Dialogue: 2,0:02:47.22,0:02:53.66,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but you know, it's quite obvious because anti-detect dashboards are frequently and actually mostly used for botting.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.26,0:02:57.10,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这是刚创建的Win11浏览器
Dialogue: 2,0:02:54.26,0:02:57.10,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So here is our Windows 11 browser.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.16,0:03:01.74,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,可修改所有参数避免网站识别
Dialogue: 2,0:02:58.16,0:03:01.74,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You can change everything so the websites don't detect us,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.80,0:03:04.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但对伪造验证码来说已足够
Dialogue: 2,0:03:01.80,0:03:04.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but that's pretty much enough for the fake captcha.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.82,0:03:12.12,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这类工具常被用来规避Facebook或谷歌的检测
Dialogue: 2,0:03:06.82,0:03:12.12,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,These tools are usually used for circumventing Facebook detection or Google detection,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.74,0:03:13.88,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,诸如此类
Dialogue: 2,0:03:12.74,0:03:13.88,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,all that kind of stuff.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.32,0:03:17.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在创建Linux版本
Dialogue: 2,0:03:14.32,0:03:17.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We'll get Linux, select Linux,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.40,0:03:26.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,选择系统-创建配置-会收到警告提示
Dialogue: 2,0:03:18.40,0:03:26.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,create profile, and we get a warning because you can't really emulate an operating system because there are too many
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.84,0:03:28.64,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因为要模拟的操作系统变量过多难以完全复刻
Dialogue: 2,0:03:26.84,0:03:28.64,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,variables they have to account for.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.04,0:03:30.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但我们继续创建
Dialogue: 2,0:03:29.04,0:03:30.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So we create that anyway.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.76,0:03:32.72,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,Linux浏览器就此生成
Dialogue: 2,0:03:30.76,0:03:32.72,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We have a Linux browser right here.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.66,0:03:37.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,最后创建macOS版本
Dialogue: 2,0:03:33.66,0:03:37.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And finally, let's create a macOS browser.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.18,0:03:39.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,macOS在这里
Dialogue: 2,0:03:38.18,0:03:39.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There's macOS.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.70,0:03:42.72,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 2,0:03:41.70,0:03:42.72,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.76,0:03:44.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 2,0:03:43.76,0:03:44.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.48,0:03:47.90,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在有了三个浏览器 可以同时启动它们
Dialogue: 2,0:03:44.48,0:03:47.90,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We have three browsers and we can start them concurrently.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.94,0:03:49.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,马上开始操作
Dialogue: 2,0:03:47.94,0:03:49.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's go ahead and do that.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.19,0:03:54.27,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,启动成功
Dialogue: 2,0:03:53.19,0:03:54.27,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.17,0:03:57.11,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,快看
Dialogue: 2,0:03:56.17,0:03:57.11,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.17,0:03:58.51,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,本质上都是谷歌浏览器
Dialogue: 2,0:03:57.17,0:03:58.51,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's basically Google Chrome,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.71,0:04:01.67,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,只不过运行在不同平台上
Dialogue: 2,0:03:58.71,0:04:01.67,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,except it's running on different platforms.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.45,0:04:04.17,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,模拟了不同操作系统
Dialogue: 2,0:04:02.45,0:04:04.17,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's emulating different platforms.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.53,0:04:07.11,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,重点来了
Dialogue: 2,0:04:05.53,0:04:07.11,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So here is the thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.33,0:04:12.23,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们要在这三个浏览器里打开假验证码网站 看看会发生什么
Dialogue: 2,0:04:07.33,0:04:12.23,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We're gonna enter the fake captcha website on these three browsers and see what happens.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.21,0:04:15.15,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,好 一切准备就绪
Dialogue: 2,0:04:13.21,0:04:15.15,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Okay, so we're pretty much ready to go.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.73,0:04:17.71,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,左侧是macOS系统
Dialogue: 2,0:04:15.73,0:04:17.71,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We have macOS on the left,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.23,0:04:20.33,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,中间是Linux 右边是Windows
Dialogue: 2,0:04:18.23,0:04:20.33,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Linux in the center, and Windows on the right.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.75,0:04:24.79,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在同时在所有浏览器运行验证码测试
Dialogue: 2,0:04:20.75,0:04:24.79,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So let's go ahead and run that captcha at the same time on every browser.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.91,0:04:29.11,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,把网址粘贴到每个地址栏
Dialogue: 2,0:04:25.91,0:04:29.11,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We're gonna paste the URL in every address bar,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.71,0:04:33.05,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,按下回车 搞定
Dialogue: 2,0:04:29.71,0:04:33.05,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,hit enter, and there we go.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.19,0:04:37.67,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,三个验证码正在不同平台的不同浏览器上运行
Dialogue: 2,0:04:33.19,0:04:37.67,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We have three captchas running in different browsers on different platforms.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.89,0:04:41.31,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我快速放大一下
Dialogue: 2,0:04:38.89,0:04:41.31,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna zoom in real quick.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.03,0:04:43.43,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这就是页面显示的内容
Dialogue: 2,0:04:42.03,0:04:43.43,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So this is how this page looks.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.05,0:04:48.27,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,“该网络因未处理恶意行为投诉已被屏蔽”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:44.05,0:04:48.27,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This network is blocked due to unaddressed abuse complaints about malicious behavior.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.51,0:04:53.69,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,“本页面正在验证请求是否来自真人而非该网络的机器人程序”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:48.51,0:04:53.69,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This page checks to see if it's really a human sending the request and not a robot coming from this network.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.27,0:04:56.15,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它还暴露了你的IP地址
Dialogue: 2,0:04:54.27,0:04:56.15,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It exposes your IP address.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.95,0:04:57.65,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,有意思
Dialogue: 2,0:04:56.95,0:04:57.65,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That's interesting.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.83,0:05:03.17,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,从没见过假验证码会显示有效真实的时间戳
Dialogue: 2,0:04:57.83,0:05:03.17,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I've never seen that before in a fake captcha and got a timestamp which is valid and actual,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.27,0:05:04.77,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,虽然显示的是UTC时间
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.27,0:05:04.77,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,except it's in UTC.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.51,0:05:10.71,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,还有这个所谓要访问的网址
Dialogue: 2,0:05:06.51,0:05:10.71,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Then the URL we're supposedly trying to access,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.45,0:05:13.27,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,用macOS或许能打开
Dialogue: 2,0:05:11.45,0:05:13.27,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which I can probably access from macOS.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.27,0:05:15.77,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,果然不存在
Dialogue: 2,0:05:14.27,0:05:15.77,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It doesn't exist, sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.07,0:05:18.99,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,等等 原来完整网址是这样的
Dialogue: 2,0:05:17.07,0:05:18.99,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh wait, that's the whole URL.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.31,0:05:21.47,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,反正根本不存在
Dialogue: 2,0:05:20.31,0:05:21.47,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh, it doesn't exist anyway.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.55,0:05:23.99,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,其实无所谓
Dialogue: 2,0:05:22.55,0:05:23.99,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.63,0:05:27.17,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,只要点击验证码
Dialogue: 2,0:05:24.63,0:05:27.17,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,As long as you press on the captcha,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.17,0:05:29.67,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,就会执行shellcode
Dialogue: 2,0:05:27.17,0:05:29.67,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,you get shellcode to execute.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.89,0:05:34.31,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我先打开记事本
Dialogue: 2,0:05:30.89,0:05:34.31,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So let me just bring up the notepad real quick.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.47,0:05:38.33,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,把收到的每个命令都粘贴进来
Dialogue: 2,0:05:35.47,0:05:38.33,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We're gonna paste every command we get into here.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.19,0:05:42.57,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,从macOS开始吧
Dialogue: 2,0:05:40.19,0:05:42.57,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So let's start from macOS.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.17,0:05:46.55,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,验证失败
Dialogue: 2,0:05:45.17,0:05:46.55,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Verification failed.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.81,0:05:48.23,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这谁能料到呢
Dialogue: 2,0:05:46.81,0:05:48.23,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh, who would have known?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.73,0:05:50.49,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,请按以下步骤操作
Dialogue: 2,0:05:48.73,0:05:50.49,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Please follow the instructions below.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.15,0:05:54.03,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,按command+空格打开聚焦搜索
Dialogue: 2,0:05:51.15,0:05:54.03,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Press command plus space to open spotlight.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.73,0:05:56.75,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,输入terminal并按回车
Dialogue: 2,0:05:54.73,0:05:56.75,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Type terminal and press return.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.45,0:05:58.71,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,复制下方命令
Dialogue: 2,0:05:57.45,0:05:58.71,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Copy the command below.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.55,0:06:03.03,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,他们给了复制选项
Dialogue: 2,0:06:00.55,0:06:03.03,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So they give you an option to copy that,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.19,0:06:05.15,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不过直接点击按钮更方便
Dialogue: 2,0:06:03.19,0:06:05.15,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but you can also press the button,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.91,0:06:10.31,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,大多数人都会这么做
Dialogue: 2,0:06:05.91,0:06:10.31,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which is obviously the easiest way and what most people will do.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.87,0:06:14.57,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在要打开macOS的终端
Dialogue: 2,0:06:11.87,0:06:14.57,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So they're asking you to open terminal on macOS.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.95,0:06:17.05,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,看看具体命令
Dialogue: 2,0:06:14.95,0:06:17.05,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's see what the command is.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.35,0:06:23.39,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这显然不是g drive验证命令
Dialogue: 2,0:06:19.35,0:06:23.39,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And the command is quite obviously not g drive verify.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.87,0:06:26.37,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,实际上是base64编码
Dialogue: 2,0:06:23.87,0:06:26.37,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's actually a base64 command.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.81,0:06:30.01,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,他们通过echo传送到终端并用bash执行
Dialogue: 2,0:06:26.81,0:06:30.01,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,They're echoing into your terminal and piping into bash.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.41,0:06:32.05,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们来解码看看
Dialogue: 2,0:06:30.41,0:06:32.05,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So let's decode that.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.02,0:06:45.38,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,正常编码是这样的
Dialogue: 2,0:06:41.02,0:06:45.38,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This is the equivalent in normal encoding.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.70,0:06:49.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,curl -s 即下载命令
Dialogue: 2,0:06:46.70,0:06:49.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,curl-s, aka download,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.44,0:06:51.02,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,下载这个文件
Dialogue: 2,0:06:49.44,0:06:51.02,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,download this file right here,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.38,0:07:00.34,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这就是启动方式
Dialogue: 2,0:06:57.38,0:07:00.34,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And that's how it starts.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.88,0:07:04.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,实际上是在往你的Mac下载可执行文件并运行
Dialogue: 2,0:07:00.88,0:07:04.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So you're actually downloading an executable into your Mac and running it.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.54,0:07:08.88,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,每次都是这样的运作原理
Dialogue: 2,0:07:05.54,0:07:08.88,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Obviously, that's how it works every single time,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.98,0:07:10.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,只不过不同平台有所差异
Dialogue: 2,0:07:08.98,0:07:10.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,except it's different for every platform.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.20,0:07:13.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这是macOS系统显示的内容
Dialogue: 2,0:07:11.20,0:07:13.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That's what it shows us for macOS.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.00,0:07:16.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,让我们切换到Linux系统看看情况
Dialogue: 2,0:07:14.00,0:07:16.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's hop onto Linux and see what happens.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.00,0:07:19.26,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我不是机器人
Dialogue: 2,0:07:18.00,0:07:19.26,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I'm not a robot.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.62,0:07:20.56,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,请验证身份
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.62,0:07:20.56,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Please verify me.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.58,0:07:22.68,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,验证失败
Dialogue: 2,0:07:21.58,0:07:22.68,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Verification failed.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.86,0:07:23.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,真遗憾
Dialogue: 2,0:07:22.86,0:07:23.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.68,0:07:24.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,G drive验证
Dialogue: 2,0:07:23.68,0:07:24.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,G drive verify.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.60,0:07:25.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,复制命令
Dialogue: 2,0:07:24.60,0:07:25.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Copy command.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.96,0:07:27.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在显示什么内容？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:25.96,0:07:27.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,What does it give us now?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.20,0:07:29.56,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,哇哦
Dialogue: 2,0:07:29.20,0:07:29.56,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.48,0:07:31.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这很有意思
Dialogue: 2,0:07:30.48,0:07:31.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That is interesting.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.62,0:07:33.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,“IWR”命令
Dialogue: 2,0:07:32.62,0:07:33.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,IWR.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.80,0:07:37.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我不确定Linux系统是否有这个命令
Dialogue: 2,0:07:33.80,0:07:37.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure there is such a command on Linux.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.34,0:07:39.60,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这里有一条注释
Dialogue: 2,0:07:38.34,0:07:39.60,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There is a comment.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.76,0:07:41.12,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,“安全验证待处理”
Dialogue: 2,0:07:39.76,0:07:41.12,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Security validation pending.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.32,0:07:43.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,“参考ID”
Dialogue: 2,0:07:41.32,0:07:43.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Ref ID, reference ID,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.18,0:07:43.70,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,之类的信息
Dialogue: 2,0:07:43.18,0:07:43.70,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,something.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.04,0:07:44.66,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,那只是注释
Dialogue: 2,0:07:44.04,0:07:44.66,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That's a comment.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.88,0:07:45.72,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们可以忽略它
Dialogue: 2,0:07:44.88,0:07:45.72,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We can ignore that.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.36,0:07:48.92,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,Linux系统有IWR命令吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:46.36,0:07:48.92,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Is there an IWR command on Linux?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.76,0:07:52.98,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,编辑人员（也就是我）请帮忙修改一下
Dialogue: 2,0:07:49.76,0:07:52.98,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Editor, aka me, please edit that in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.06,0:07:59.31,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(2744,1922)}它在任何 Linux 发行版上都无法运行
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.80,0:07:58.00,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这基本上表示“调用网络请求”
Dialogue: 2,0:07:54.80,0:07:58.00,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And it basically, that means invoke web request.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.40,0:08:03.26,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它会从wetnova.best下载某些内容
Dialogue: 2,0:07:59.40,0:08:03.26,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It downloads something from wetnova.best.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.32,0:08:06.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这是Linux系统的情况
Dialogue: 2,0:08:04.32,0:08:06.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That's the Linux side of things.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.68,0:08:10.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,让我们看看Windows系统会显示什么
Dialogue: 2,0:08:07.68,0:08:10.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's see what Windows has to offer.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.45,0:08:20.63,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,“按下Windows键加X键”
Dialogue: 2,0:08:18.45,0:08:20.63,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Press the Windows key plus X.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.99,0:08:22.07,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这个倒是新发现
Dialogue: 2,0:08:20.99,0:08:22.07,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That is new.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.91,0:08:27.53,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,Win+X确实会在左下角调出这个小型功能菜单
Dialogue: 2,0:08:22.91,0:08:27.53,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So Windows plus X gives you a little power menu right here on the bottom left.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.43,0:08:31.01,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,“按I键打开终端”
Dialogue: 2,0:08:28.43,0:08:31.01,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And press I to open terminal.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.25,0:08:33.89,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这个操作确实有效
Dialogue: 2,0:08:32.25,0:08:33.89,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And that is true.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.13,0:08:36.87,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,可以看到字母I下方有下划线
Dialogue: 2,0:08:34.13,0:08:36.87,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You can see the I being underlined.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.07,0:08:38.33,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这意味着如果我们按下I键
Dialogue: 2,0:08:37.07,0:08:38.33,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That means if we press I,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.73,0:08:40.11,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,就会打开终端
Dialogue: 2,0:08:38.73,0:08:40.11,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,it's opening the terminal.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.59,0:08:43.39,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,“按Ctrl+V再按回车键进行验证”
Dialogue: 2,0:08:40.59,0:08:43.39,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Press control V and press enter to verify,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.65,0:08:45.17,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但我们不打算执行这个操作
Dialogue: 2,0:08:43.65,0:08:45.17,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which we're not going to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.59,0:08:49.69,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,来看看具体是什么命令
Dialogue: 2,0:08:47.59,0:08:49.69,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's see what the command is.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.99,0:08:53.59,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这就是Windows系统下的命令
Dialogue: 2,0:08:50.99,0:08:53.59,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That is the command for Windows.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.31,0:08:57.55,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,其基本思路如出一辙
Dialogue: 2,0:08:55.31,0:08:57.55,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So the idea is basically the same.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.71,0:09:01.53,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,他们在末尾添加了小段注释
Dialogue: 2,0:08:57.71,0:09:01.53,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,They give us a little comment at the end,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.31,0:09:03.83,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,以此消除我们的疑心
Dialogue: 2,0:09:02.31,0:09:03.83,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,so we don't feel suspicious.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.75,0:09:12.45,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,然后我们收到“调用网络请求 wetnova.best/collapse.png”的指令
Dialogue: 2,0:09:04.75,0:09:12.45,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And then we get invoke web request wetnova.best collapse.png and then pipes it to IEX,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.53,0:09:13.99,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,随后通过管道传递给IEX
Dialogue: 2,0:09:12.53,0:09:13.99,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which is important for PowerShell,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.11,0:09:16.05,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这在PowerShell中非常关键
Dialogue: 2,0:09:14.11,0:09:16.05,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,because if you invoke the web request,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.11,0:09:16.65,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因为仅发起网络请求还不够
Dialogue: 2,0:09:16.11,0:09:16.65,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,it's not enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.71,0:09:18.05,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,必须同时执行下载的内容
Dialogue: 2,0:09:16.71,0:09:18.05,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You have to execute that as well.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.69,0:09:20.77,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这正是IEX命令的作用
Dialogue: 2,0:09:18.69,0:09:20.77,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So that's what the IEX command does.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.35,0:09:25.11,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它会执行你下载的文件
Dialogue: 2,0:09:21.35,0:09:25.11,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It executes the stuff you download.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.07,0:09:31.09,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,很明显这是个可执行文件
Dialogue: 2,0:09:29.07,0:09:31.09,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Obviously, that's an executable file.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.53,0:09:35.15,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在让我们看看wetnova.best网站暗藏什么玄机
Dialogue: 2,0:09:31.53,0:09:35.15,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So let's see what wetnova.best has to offer.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.95,0:09:38.85,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们将在Linux浏览器中运行wetnova.best网站
Dialogue: 2,0:09:35.95,0:09:38.85,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We're going to run wetnova.best on the Linux browser.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.05,0:09:44.53,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在显示对象未找到
Dialogue: 2,0:09:43.05,0:09:44.53,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Now, object not found.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.69,0:09:46.57,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,可能已经被移除了
Dialogue: 2,0:09:44.69,0:09:46.57,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's probably been removed already,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.11,0:09:49.67,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,除非我们尝试用curl命令访问
Dialogue: 2,0:09:47.11,0:09:49.67,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,unless we can try that with curl.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.83,0:09:58.05,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在我们要用Notepad++打开这个文件
Dialogue: 2,0:09:53.83,0:09:58.05,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So we're going to open this in notepad++ now.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.81,0:10:02.01,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,没错 这是个空文件
Dialogue: 2,0:09:59.81,0:10:02.01,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is an empty file.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.49,0:10:02.73,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 2,0:10:02.49,0:10:02.73,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.13,0:10:04.77,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这确实不太走运
Dialogue: 2,0:10:03.13,0:10:04.77,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So that's unfortunate.
