Dialogue: 2,0:10:05.09,0:10:07.49,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We don't get to see what it has to offer.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.01,0:10:11.69,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不过让我们看看collapse.png文件里藏着什么
Dialogue: 2,0:10:08.01,0:10:11.69,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But let's see what collapse.png has in store for us.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.87,0:10:14.81,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们将在Windows浏览器中运行
Dialogue: 2,0:10:12.87,0:10:14.81,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We're going to run this on the Windows browser.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.99,0:10:15.81,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,其实用哪个系统并不重要
Dialogue: 2,0:10:14.99,0:10:15.81,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It doesn't really matter,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.07,0:10:19.35,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但为了保持原汁原味
Dialogue: 2,0:10:16.07,0:10:19.35,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but we're trying to stay authentic.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.45,0:10:25.69,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,确实 这是个损坏的文件
Dialogue: 2,0:10:23.45,0:10:25.69,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And yeah, that's a damaged file.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.75,0:10:27.85,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,为什么说它损坏了呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:10:26.75,0:10:27.85,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Why is it damaged?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.97,0:10:30.01,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因为它实际上根本不是PNG文件
Dialogue: 2,0:10:27.97,0:10:30.01,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Because it's actually not a PNG file.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.57,0:10:32.15,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而是一个可执行文件
Dialogue: 2,0:10:30.57,0:10:32.15,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's an executable file.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.31,0:10:33.27,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,确切说是PowerShell脚本
Dialogue: 2,0:10:32.31,0:10:33.27,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's a PowerShell script.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.51,0:10:36.25,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,如果我们下载这个PNG文件并重命名为txt格式
Dialogue: 2,0:10:33.51,0:10:36.25,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,If we download this PNG file and rename it to txt,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.33,0:10:37.91,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,就能看到它的真实内容
Dialogue: 2,0:10:36.33,0:10:37.91,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,we can actually see what it does.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.29,0:10:39.61,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们马上操作一下
Dialogue: 2,0:10:38.29,0:10:39.61,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So let's do that real quick.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.39,0:10:43.49,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这就是collapse.png文件内部
Dialogue: 2,0:10:40.39,0:10:43.49,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This is the collapse.png inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.83,0:10:47.45,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这是个经过混淆处理的脚本 包含几个函数
Dialogue: 2,0:10:43.83,0:10:47.45,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's an obfuscated script with a couple functions.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.73,0:10:50.33,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,看起来很有料
Dialogue: 2,0:10:48.73,0:10:50.33,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It seems to be juicy.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.43,0:10:52.37,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,内部内容相当丰富
Dialogue: 2,0:10:50.43,0:10:52.37,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It seems to be really juicy inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.83,0:10:54.35,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,目前我还无法完全解读
Dialogue: 2,0:10:52.83,0:10:54.35,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I can't really read that so far,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.47,0:10:57.63,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但我能看到...这难道是勒索软件？
Dialogue: 2,0:10:54.47,0:10:57.63,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but I can see... is this a ransomware?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.05,0:11:01.43,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,使用了AES托管密码模式的加密技术
Dialogue: 2,0:10:59.05,0:11:01.43,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,AES managed cipher mode cryptography.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.63,0:11:01.87,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 2,0:11:01.63,0:11:01.87,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.89,0:11:06.07,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我敢打赌这绝对是勒索软件
Dialogue: 2,0:11:03.89,0:11:06.07,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,How much you want to bet it's a ransomware?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.49,0:11:11.89,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,确实很难分辨具体情况所有代码都被混淆得面目全非
Dialogue: 2,0:11:07.49,0:11:11.89,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's definitely hard to tell what's going on here because everything is so obfuscated.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.03,0:11:13.89,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但我能看到导入的模块 
Dialogue: 2,0:11:12.03,0:11:13.89,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But I can see the imports.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.47,0:11:17.29,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,确实 导入模块必须保持可读性
Dialogue: 2,0:11:14.47,0:11:17.29,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The imports actually have to be readable.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.03,0:11:19.69,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,显示窗口 获取控制台窗口 
Dialogue: 2,0:11:18.03,0:11:19.69,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Show window, get console window.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.57,0:11:22.53,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,密码学是怎么回事呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:11:20.57,0:11:22.53,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,What's up with cryptography,though?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.27,0:11:24.55,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,Base64编码字符串
Dialogue: 2,0:11:23.27,0:11:24.55,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Base64 string.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.03,0:11:26.97,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,至少字符串内容是可以翻译的
Dialogue: 2,0:11:25.03,0:11:26.97,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh, you can translate the strings at least.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.47,0:11:30.29,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这同样说明不了任何问题 
Dialogue: 2,0:11:28.47,0:11:30.29,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That also means nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.89,0:11:33.83,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这肯定是可执行代码
Dialogue: 2,0:11:31.89,0:11:33.83,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This must be executable code.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.33,0:11:39.55,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我觉得他们只是把代码混淆后再把所有内容拼接在一起
Dialogue: 2,0:11:34.33,0:11:39.55,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I think they just obfuscated it and they're then concatenating everything together.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.65,0:11:42.05,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我有种预感 
Dialogue: 2,0:11:40.65,0:11:42.05,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.31,0:11:53.93,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,他们在这里解码的其实是一个二进制文件然后把它编译成可执行程序
Dialogue: 2,0:11:46.31,0:11:53.93,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,What they're decoding here is basically a binary file that it's then compiling into an exe.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.25,0:11:55.83,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,其实不算是编译
Dialogue: 2,0:11:54.25,0:11:55.83,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Well, not really compiling,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.01,0:11:57.01,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但你明白我的意思 
Dialogue: 2,0:11:56.01,0:11:57.01,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.07,0:12:03.93,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它正在拼接那个字符串然后把所有内容组合起来生成可执行文件
Dialogue: 2,0:11:57.07,0:12:03.93,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's concatenating that string and then adding everything together to make an executable file.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.47,0:12:09.37,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,所以可执行文件就在这里面因为它的长度有两兆字节
Dialogue: 2,0:12:04.47,0:12:09.37,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So the executable file is in here because the length of it is two megabytes,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.51,0:12:11.85,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,至少以base64编码的形式存在 
Dialogue: 2,0:12:09.51,0:12:11.85,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,at least in base64.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.85,0:12:14.09,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而Base64的编码比例
Dialogue: 2,0:12:11.85,0:12:14.09,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And the ratio of base64 is,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.21,0:12:16.21,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,大概是四分之三左右的比例
Dialogue: 2,0:12:14.21,0:12:16.21,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I think, four thirds or something like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.05,0:12:19.61,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这就是你在Mac系统上运行的程序
Dialogue: 2,0:12:17.05,0:12:19.61,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This is what you're running being on Mac OS.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.11,0:12:23.95,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它正在通过管道传输给bash
Dialogue: 2,0:12:22.11,0:12:23.95,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's being piped to bash.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.75,0:12:26.15,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们来看看这是什么
Dialogue: 2,0:12:24.75,0:12:26.15,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's see what this is.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.39,0:12:35.33,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,是啊 估计短时间内是看不到那个IP地址有任何动静了 
Dialogue: 2,0:12:30.39,0:12:35.33,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't think we're going to see anything coming from that IP address anytime soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.73,0:12:37.61,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,看来这个方法确实行不通 
Dialogue: 2,0:12:35.73,0:12:37.61,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So apparently that does not work.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.81,0:12:40.91,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但这个思路本身是成立的 
Dialogue: 2,0:12:38.81,0:12:40.91,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But the idea still stands.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.85,0:12:45.83,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,每个平台都设有验证码机制 你无处可逃 
Dialogue: 2,0:12:41.85,0:12:45.83,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There is a captcha for every platform and you can't get away from it.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.07,0:12:47.29,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你会被骗的 
Dialogue: 2,0:12:46.07,0:12:47.29,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You will get scammed,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.85,0:12:49.03,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,即便你用的是Mac系统
Dialogue: 2,0:12:47.85,0:12:49.03,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,even if you're on Mac OS,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.27,0:12:50.23,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,即便你用的是Linux系统
Dialogue: 2,0:12:49.27,0:12:50.23,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,even if you're on Linux.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.95,0:12:55.27,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,每个平台都有专属指令会让你上当受骗 
Dialogue: 2,0:12:50.95,0:12:55.27,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There is a separate command for every platform that will get you baited.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.37,0:12:57.57,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,就是这样 
Dialogue: 2,0:12:56.37,0:12:57.57,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So there it is.
